msgstr "GCompris ameddakkel n yiselmaden"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.gcompris-teachers.appdata.xml:18
msgid ""
"GCompris-teachers is a companion application for teachers to enhance their "
"use of GCompris in their classroom."
msgstr ""
"GCompris-iselmaden d asnas ameddakkel i yiselmaden i usnerni aseqdec-nsen n "
"GCompris deg ismilen-nsen."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.gcompris-teachers.appdata.xml:19
msgid ""
"It allows teachers to create customized datasets and receive pupils results "
"for some activities."
msgstr ""
"Yessirig iselmaden ad rnun tigrummiwin n yisefka tisaganin, ad d-ṭṭfen igmaḍ "
"n yinelmaden i kra n yirmad."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
